The stations, departures and disruptions come from the official API of NS
(Nederlandse Spoorwegen), https://apiportal.ns.nl, read with the personal key
of each user and under the terms of use of the NS API portal. The widgets show
the source (NS) and the time of each reading.

The files under test/fixtures are reduced answers of the NS API recorded by the
perron project (https://github.com/ultimatelemon/perron), Copyright (c) 2026
UltimateLemon, MIT License.

